<title>BELGIUM: EU commision corrects grain import duty changes.</title>
<headline>EU commision corrects grain import duty changes.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will on Sunday cut import duties on transatlantic imports of durum wheat and low quality soft wheat, the European Commission said, revising and correcting figures released earlier in the day.</p>
<p>But duties will be raised on imports of high- and medium quality soft wheat, barley, sorghum, rye and maize, it added.</p>
</text>
